{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0087-s002", "text": "Om du har fått personbeteckningen hos Migrationsverket (Maahanmuuttovirasto) eller skatteförvaltningen (Vero), måste du vanligtvis också registrera en tillfällig eller stadigvarande bostadsadress hos Myndigheten för digitalisering och befolkningsdata (Digi- ja väestötietovirasto).", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T075109789308+0000-4/hb-c12-u0087-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 24.171972789115646, "peak": 0.49517822265625, "generation_seconds": 84.30237702303566, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0087-s003", "text": "När du registrerar en stadigvarande adress och hemkommun, får du till exempel använda de kommunala tjänsterna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T075109789308+0000-4/hb-c12-u0087-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.961360544217687, "peak": 0.4345703125, "generation_seconds": 29.693286143010482, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0088-s001", "text": "Du kan få en personbeteckning om du lagligt vistas i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T075109789308+0000-4/hb-c12-u0088-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.433469387755102, "peak": 0.26983642578125, "generation_seconds": 17.197852895827964, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0088-s002", "text": "En laglig vistelse kan grunda sig på till exempel ett uppehållstillstånd, fri rörlighet för EU-medborgare, ett visum eller visumfrihet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T075109789308+0000-4/hb-c12-u0088-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.981496598639456, "peak": 0.261444091796875, "generation_seconds": 42.35911866487004, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0088-s003", "text": "Dessutom krävs det att ett av följande villkor uppfylls:", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T075109789308+0000-4/hb-c12-u0088-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.50312925170068, "peak": 0.36944580078125, "generation_seconds": 16.89640063699335, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0089-s001", "text": "Du behöver en personbeteckning för arbete, studier eller en motsvarande orsak som äger rum i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T075109789308+0000-4/hb-c12-u0089-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.70748299319728, "peak": 0.2872314453125, "generation_seconds": 26.38064909307286, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0091-s001", "text": "Din familjemedlem har redan en registrerad adress i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T075109789308+0000-4/hb-c12-u0091-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.433469387755102, "peak": 0.27301025390625, "generation_seconds": 18.223532611038536, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0092-s001", "text": "Migrationsverket har beviljat dig ett uppehållstillstånd eller uppehållskort eller registrerat din uppehållsrätt för EU-medborgare i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T075109789308+0000-4/hb-c12-u0092-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.469115646258503, "peak": 0.287750244140625, "generation_seconds": 38.68959521711804, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
